<title>PORTUGAL: BES bids for remaining BIC share.</title>
<headline>BES bids for remaining BIC share.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Espirito Santo, which controls 99.604 percent of the capital of Banco Internacional de Credito (BIC), is launching a public offer to buy (OPA) for the remaining shares offering 2,790 escudos per share.</p>
<p>A note published in Lisbon bourse's official bulletin said the suscription period would run until February 20.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
